@startuml
title Smart sladding - overall flow

start
:PDF in;
:Render the pages to images;

fork
  :OCR reads the text and finds\nvalid fødselsnummer;
fork again
  :Image model (YOLO) looks for\nregions resembling a fødselsnummer;
end fork

:Findings are merged\nand quality-checked;
:Sladd boxes are placed\nover the fødselsnummer;
:Result out: boxes as JSON;
stop
@enduml
